{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（16日）上午8時50分，一輛5號線九巴行經尖沙咀漆咸道南125號天主教玫瑰堂對開時，車上一名七旬翁疑跌倒。救援人員到場時事主昏迷不醒，將他送</p><p>現場消息稱，事主在科學館站上車，車行途中他疑跌倒撞傷；關愛座下面遺下少量血迹。現場可見，科學館站及九巴停車位置相距約100米。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132263527168741376537968.jpeg/QLCClLwPc_Q3NhGe1Pfcy-MYJsJmB8YMVlVTkHxVU5A\" alt=\"關愛座旁邊有血迹。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>關愛座旁邊有血迹。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132263524433924096584390.jpeg/xLcCD060DvgbXhA0PeeEVn_sTKfMqM6IhNpkp67aZKc\" alt=\"關愛座旁邊有血迹。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>關愛座旁邊有血迹。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132263521736855552519203.jpeg/wSGduThKvQR3GB_hajeiagSnwHLf2sndigSB2KAEgdg\" alt=\"警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132263519073341440634027.jpeg/Oge19k6WsS_X41hEat7o2eOrnqK7sl0idChRg14oUYM\" alt=\"警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T04:10:56.317195+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}